---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy | GLucak" description="What this site does with your information.">
  <section class="band" aria-labelledby="h-privacy">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1 id="h-privacy" class="prose-h">Privacy</h1>
      <p>If you join the email list, we use your email address to send you news about shows and new music. The sign-up is handled by Kit, our email service. You can unsubscribe from any email.</p>
      <p>The Spotify player on this site loads from Spotify, and the video player loads from YouTube only after you tap it. Those services may set their own cookies under their own policies.</p>
      <p>This site sets no tracking cookies of its own. The only thing it remembers in your browser is your Motion on/off choice.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
